  <main>
    <section id="top" class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> A FIELD GUIDE TO THE EXTRAORDINARY</p>
        <h1 id="hero-title">A little<br>further <em>out.</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-description">Leave the ordinary behind. Find a little perspective<br class="desktop-break"> in the worlds that make up our cosmic neighborhood.</p>
        <a class="button" href="#solar-system">Explore the solar system <span class="arrow-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>
        <div class="hero-footnote"><span class="tiny-orbit" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" width="32" height="32" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 3v34M3 20h34M8 8l24 24M8 32L32 8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span><p>One star. Eight planets.<br><span>Endless reasons to look up.</span></p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="cosmos" role="img" aria-label="An illustrated Saturn with sweeping golden rings against a star filled sky">
        <div class="orbital-path path-one"></div><div class="orbital-path path-two"></div>
        <span class="cosmic-coordinate">06 / SOLAR SYSTEM</span>
        <div class="planet-system" data-world="saturn"><div class="ring ring-back"></div><div class="planet"></div><div class="ring ring-front"></div></div>
        <div class="planet-label"><span class="label-line"></span><span class="label-name">SATURN</span><span class="label-detail">The ringed giant</span></div>
        <span class="cosmic-note">NOT EVERYTHING NEEDS<br>TO REVOLVE AROUND YOU.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-bottom"><span>YOUR NEXT CHANGE OF PERSPECTIVE</span><a href="#explore" aria-label="Scroll to explore">SCROLL TO DISCOVER <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
    </section>
    <section id="solar-system" class="solar-section" aria-labelledby="solar-title">
      <div class="section-heading solar-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / THE LIVE ORBITAL EXPLORER</p><h2 id="solar-title">Your universe. <em>In motion.</em></h2></div><p>Eight worlds. One extraordinary star.<br>Choose a planet. Get a little closer.</p></div>
      <div class="solar-shell">
        <div class="solar-stage" id="solar-stage">
          <div class="solar-poster" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="poster-orbits"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="poster-sun"></div>
            <span class="poster-planet poster-earth"></span><span class="poster-planet poster-saturn"></span><span class="poster-planet poster-neptune"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="solar-canvas" id="solar-canvas"></div>
          <div class="solar-topline"><span><span class="status-dot"></span> SOL / OUR SOLAR SYSTEM</span><span id="solar-status" role="status">PREPARING YOUR UNIVERSE</span></div>
          <div class="solar-panel" id="solar-panel" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
            <div class="planet-card-topline"><p class="solar-kicker" id="solar-kicker">A COSMIC NEIGHBORHOOD</p><button id="solar-card-close" class="planet-card-close" type="button" aria-label="Close planet details" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="14" height="14" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 4 8 8m0-8-8 8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button></div>
            <div class="planet-card-heading"><div><h3 id="solar-name">A bigger picture.</h3><p id="solar-subtitle">A small place in an extraordinary universe.</p></div><span class="planet-card-globe" id="solar-card-globe" aria-hidden="true" hidden></span></div>
            <span class="planet-card-kind" id="solar-kind" hidden></span>
            <p id="solar-description">Follow the light from Mercury to Neptune. Every world has a story. Where will you go first?</p>
            <dl id="solar-facts" hidden><div><dt>From the Sun</dt><dd id="solar-distance"></dd></div><div><dt>One orbit</dt><dd id="solar-year"></dd></div><div><dt>Diameter</dt><dd id="solar-diameter"></dd></div></dl>
            <a id="solar-learn" href="https://science.nasa.gov/solar-system/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore with NASA <span class="arrow-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>
          </div>
          <div class="solar-view-controls" aria-label="View controls"><button id="solar-zoom-in" type="button" aria-label="Zoom in" title="Zoom in">+</button><button id="solar-zoom-out" type="button" aria-label="Zoom out" title="Zoom out">−</button><button id="solar-fullscreen" type="button" aria-label="Enter fullscreen" title="Fullscreen"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 2H2v5m11-5h5v5M2 13v5h5m6 0h5v-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></button></div>
          <span class="solar-hover" id="solar-hover" hidden></span>
          <button class="solar-gestures" id="solar-gestures" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Enable touch exploration</button>
          <div class="solar-scene-note"><span id="solar-hint">DRAG TO ORBIT · SCROLL TO ZOOM</span><span>ILLUSTRATIVE SCALE · ARTISTIC SURFACES</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="solar-toolbar"><div class="solar-playback"><button id="solar-play" type="button" aria-label="Pause orbital motion" aria-pressed="false"><span id="solar-play-icon" class="playback-icon paused-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span><span id="solar-play-text">Pause</span></button><span class="toolbar-divider"></span><span class="speed-label" id="solar-speed-label">ORBIT SPEED</span><div id="solar-speed" class="solar-speed-options" role="group" aria-labelledby="solar-speed-label"><button type="button" data-speed="0.25" aria-pressed="false">Slow</button><button type="button" data-speed="1" aria-pressed="true">Normal</button><button type="button" data-speed="4" aria-pressed="false">Fast</button></div><output id="solar-motion-state" aria-live="polite">Playing · 1×</output></div><div class="solar-actions"><button id="solar-reset" type="button">Overview <span aria-hidden="true">↺</span></button><button id="solar-tour" class="tour-button" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Take the tour <span class="arrow-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></div></div>
        <nav class="solar-planets" aria-label="Choose a planet"><button type="button" data-focus="mercury" aria-pressed="false"><span style="--planet-color:#a89d8e"></span><small>01</small>Mercury</button><button type="button" data-focus="venus" aria-pressed="false"><span style="--planet-color:#d8ae73"></span><small>02</small>Venus</button><button type="button" data-focus="earth" aria-pressed="false"><span style="--planet-color:#75b5df"></span><small>03</small>Earth</button><button type="button" data-focus="mars" aria-pressed="false"><span style="--planet-color:#d99769"></span><small>04</small>Mars</button><button type="button" data-focus="jupiter" aria-pressed="false"><span style="--planet-color:#d8b18c"></span><small>05</small>Jupiter</button><button type="button" data-focus="saturn" aria-pressed="false"><span style="--planet-color:#dcc8a0"></span><small>06</small>Saturn</button><button type="button" data-focus="uranus" aria-pressed="false"><span style="--planet-color:#a0d9d7"></span><small>07</small>Uranus</button><button type="button" data-focus="neptune" aria-pressed="false"><span style="--planet-color:#658de3"></span><small>08</small>Neptune</button></nav>
      </div>
      <p class="solar-caption">A little room for wonder. <span>Planet sizes, distances, and orbital motion are adjusted for exploration.</span></p>
    </section>
    <section id="explore" class="explore" aria-labelledby="explore-title">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / PICK YOUR DESTINATION</p><h2 id="explore-title">Worlds worth wondering about.</h2></div><p>Same solar system.<br>Entirely different worlds.</p></div>
      <div class="destination-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Planet destinations">
        <button id="tab-saturn" class="destination active" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="planet-info" data-planet="saturn"><span class="mini-planet mini-saturn" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Saturn<small>THE RINGED GIANT</small></span><span class="tab-arrow arrow-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
        <button id="tab-mars" class="destination" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="planet-info" tabindex="-1" data-planet="mars"><span class="mini-planet mini-mars" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Mars<small>THE RED PLANET</small></span><span class="tab-arrow arrow-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
        <button id="tab-neptune" class="destination" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="planet-info" tabindex="-1" data-planet="neptune"><span class="mini-planet mini-neptune" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Neptune<small>BEYOND THE BLUE</small></span><span class="tab-arrow arrow-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
      </div>
      <div id="planet-info" class="planet-info" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-saturn" aria-live="polite"><div class="planet-story"><span class="story-index">06</span><div><h3 id="planet-title">A world with a signature.</h3><p id="planet-description">Billions of pieces of ice and rock. One extraordinary silhouette. Saturn reminds us that the most beautiful things are often a little unconventional.</p><a id="planet-link" href="https://science.nasa.gov/saturn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get to know Saturn <span class="arrow-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></div></div><dl class="planet-facts"><div><dt>DISTANCE FROM SUN</dt><dd id="planet-distance">1.4 billion <small>km</small></dd></div><div><dt>ONE YEAR ON SATURN</dt><dd id="planet-year">29.4 <small>Earth years</small></dd></div><div><dt>PLANET TYPE</dt><dd id="planet-type">Gas giant</dd></div></dl></div>
    </section>
    <section id="big-bang" class="bang-section" aria-labelledby="bang-title">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / THE STORY BEFORE THE STARS</p><h2 id="bang-title">Everything. <em>From a beginning.</em></h2></div><p>13.8 billion years in the making.<br>A journey through the birth of our universe.</p></div>
      <div class="bang-shell">
        <div class="bang-stage">
          <canvas id="bang-canvas" aria-label="Artistic visualization of the universe expanding and forming cosmic structure"></canvas>
          <div class="bang-topline"><span><span class="status-dot"></span> THE ORIGIN OBSERVATORY</span><span>SPACE ITSELF IS EXPANDING</span></div>
          <div class="bang-scene-copy"><p id="bang-scene-era">THE EARLIEST FRONTIER</p><h3 id="bang-scene-title">Before the<br>first light.</h3><p id="bang-scene-caption">A hotter, denser universe. An extraordinary beginning.</p></div>
          <div class="bang-clock"><span>TIME SINCE THE BIG BANG</span><strong id="bang-time">&lt; 10⁻⁴³ seconds</strong><span id="bang-temperature">Beyond tested physics</span></div>
          <div class="bang-scene-footer"><span>AN ARTISTIC HISTORY OF THE COSMOS</span><span id="bang-chapter">01 / 08</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="bang-transport">
          <button id="bang-play" class="bang-primary" type="button" aria-pressed="false"><span id="bang-play-symbol" aria-hidden="true"></span><span id="bang-play-label">Begin the journey</span></button>
          <button id="bang-replay" type="button" aria-label="Restart the cosmic timeline">↺ <span>Restart</span></button>
          <label class="bang-scrub-label" for="bang-scrub">COSMIC TIMELINE</label><input id="bang-scrub" type="range" min="0" max="1000" value="0" aria-label="Explore the history of the universe" aria-valuetext="Earliest frontier">
          <output id="bang-progress">0%</output>
        </div>
        <div class="bang-epochs" role="group" aria-label="Choose a cosmic era"></div>
        <div class="bang-dossier" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
          <div class="bang-story"><p class="eyebrow" id="bang-dossier-kicker">CHAPTER 01 / THE EARLIEST FRONTIER</p><h3 id="bang-detail-title">The edge of what we know.</h3><p id="bang-description"></p><div class="bang-insight"><span>LOOK CLOSER</span><p id="bang-insight"></p></div></div>
          <div class="bang-science"><dl><div><dt>UNIVERSE AT THIS STAGE</dt><dd id="bang-state"></dd></div><div><dt>THE TRANSFORMATION</dt><dd id="bang-process"></dd></div></dl><div class="bang-evidence"><span id="bang-evidence-label">WHAT WE KNOW</span><p id="bang-evidence"></p></div><a href="https://science.nasa.gov/universe/overview/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore the science with NASA <span class="arrow-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bang-notes"><p><span>∞</span> An expansion of space, everywhere. The Big Bang was not an explosion into an empty room; there is no known central point.</p><p>Illustrative particles and colors. Chapters have equal playback time, not equal duration in cosmic history. Early times and temperatures are approximate; the earliest physics remains uncertain.</p></div>
    </section>
    <section id="perspective" class="perspective" aria-labelledby="perspective-title"><span class="perspective-star" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" width="32" height="32" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 3v34M3 20h34M8 8l24 24M8 32L32 8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span><p class="eyebrow">04 / A SHIFT IN PERSPECTIVE</p><h2 id="perspective-title">Big universe.<br><em>Beautifully small us.</em></h2><p>Sometimes, all it takes is looking up to see things differently.<br>Stay curious. Take the scenic route. There’s a whole universe out there.</p><a href="https://science.nasa.gov/universe/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Keep looking up <span class="arrow-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></section>
  </main>
